WEBVTT

00:07:29.028 --> 00:07:33.532
Then three, what I call
this is acceptance,

00:07:33.532 --> 00:07:37.912
like self-kind, self-love,
self-compassion.

00:07:37.953 --> 00:07:40.289
You let panic come and go,

00:07:40.331 --> 00:07:42.458
that's the real acceptance, isn't it?

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.460
So three in one:

00:07:44.502 --> 00:07:46.921
awareness, love and compassion, wisdom.

00:07:46.921 --> 00:07:49.882
Sometimes what I call
buy one, get two free.

00:07:49.882 --> 00:07:51.050
(Laughter)

00:07:51.091 --> 00:07:52.384
Big deal, right?

00:07:52.801 --> 00:07:55.304
And all this because of panic.

00:07:56.055 --> 00:07:58.390
So now panic becomes your teacher,

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:00.226
your best friend.